# Google Maps pin

Every school `addresses` entry must include `mapsUrl`. Coordinates alone are not enough. Without `mapsUrl`, the map link is only a camera position and has no pin.

- `mapsUrl` is `https://www.google.com/maps?cid=DECIMAL`
- The decimal comes from the second hex of `0x…:0xCID`: `int(hex, 16)`
- `lat` and `lng` are the place pin (`!3dLAT!4dLNG` or `[null,null,LAT,LNG]`), not the map camera (`@lat,lng`)
- Use the listing for that venue. A nearby place in the same complex is the wrong pin (SPENS pools are not the bowling alley, and the sports center is not the indoor pool)

```ts
{
  street: 'Bazeni SPENS-a, Sutjeska 2',
  city: 'Novi Sad',
  district: 'Stari Grad (Centar)',
  lat: 45.24634,
  lng: 19.8461232,
  mapsUrl: 'https://www.google.com/maps?cid=5659167617721317525',
}
```
